WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.601
-Hey, Bob. Welcome to the show.
-Hey.

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:05.267
-Good to see ya.
-Jimmy.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:06.901
-Hey, you want to
play Hot Hands?

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:08.968
-Sure. Alright. Yeah.

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:10.400
Alright?
-Yep.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.400
Oh! you won.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.934
Yeah.

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:15.767
-You alright?
-That's how you play?

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:18.067
-Little bit, yeah.
-Oh. Okay.

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:22.100
-Oh, you got me.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:25.501
-[ Laughs ] This is fun.

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.100
-Yeah. Okay. Now my turn.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.300
-Ooh! [ Laughs ]

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.400
Oh.
[ Both laugh ]

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:32.634
-Oh!
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:45.968
-Jimmy, we're a minute out.
-Oh. Okay.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.467
Two for flinching.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:49.567
-Okay.
-Yeah?

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:55.167
-Okay, see you out there, buddy.

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:57.968
-[ Groans ]
Thank you for being here.

